1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,544
F one is h one rho g A, downwards.

2
00:00:04,544 --> 00:00:08,463
F two is h two rho g A, upwards.

3
00:00:08,463 --> 00:00:14,934
Their difference is h two minus h one, times A rho g, which is V rho g.

4
00:00:14,934 --> 00:00:19,700
And V rho is just the mass of water the body pushes aside.

